{{!-- Share, at the foot of a reader sidebar: a label and four small
buttons on one line. The boxed widget it replaces carried an
uppercase heading and 4rem targets — a lot of furniture for the
least-used thing in the rail. --}}
<div class="share-compact">
    <span class="share-compact-label">{{> "icons/share"}} {{t "Share"}}</span>
    {{> "widgets/share-links"}}
</div>
